From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rdkb-cli: identify and enlarge topology STAs

The live model commonly leaves clientType empty, causing every client tooltip
to say "STA: Unknown" and making otherwise identical phone icons impossible to
distinguish at a glance.

Keep device type and identity separate.  Derive a stable compact display name
from the client MAC address, render it beneath each STA, and retain the full
MAC in the tooltip.  Lab client MACs such as 02:00:00:00:03:00 become STA-03;
other valid MACs use their last three octets.  Double the existing STA icon
size and increase its placement radius to leave room for the larger icon and
label.

---
